  "description": "An annual American holiday celebrated on the fourth Thursday of November, centered around a traditional meal featuring turkey, stuffing, cranberry sauce, and pumpkin pie. It commemorates the harvest and has historical roots in the Pilgrims' first harvest feast in 1621. The holiday is culturally specific to the United States and is not recognized or celebrated in China.",
